+"""NKE PROVOR CTS4 / decoder-301 Iridium-SBD telemetry front-end.
+
+Phase 1 scope (contract: ``provor_bio_irsbd/PROVOR_CTS4_PHASE1_DESIGN_NOTE.md``
+§6): raw ``.sbd`` → 140-byte framer → packet dispatch → generic cycle
+attribution → raw CTD extraction.
+
+Phase 2A scope (additive; same contract plus the Phase-2A task order): decode
+of parameter packets 255/254 (:mod:`params`), technical packets 253/252/251/250
+(:mod:`tech`), BGC raw extraction (:mod:`bgc`), raw→calibrated BGC equations
+(:mod:`equations`), family-generic association (:mod:`assoc`), and decoder-301
+label maps (:mod:`labels_301`). No calibration publication, no NetCDF emission,
+no CSV writes, no WMO logic.
+
+Byte authority: NKE ``5.8_MUT_PROVBIOII-FLBB_UTI_GB_Rev3_20130924`` §7
+(first-party manual; preserved at ``provor_bio_irsbd/ref/``).
+
+Deliberately OUT of scope: WMO naming, NetCDF emission, CSV writes, and any
+change to the existing ARVOR-I (``provor_ir_sbd``) / APEX (``apex_argos``)
+code. This package is standalone and imports nothing from those subpackages.
+"""
+
+from __future__ import annotations
+
